test('trainer test challenge reserve review retains restrictions and current request',async()=>{for(const sketch of [false,true]){const doc=await activeTrainerTestAliasApiFixture({sketch,challenge:true}),h=harness({document:doc,apply:game.applyClassicAction,view:game.classicGameView}),before=h.row().data,view=await(await h.get()).json(),preview=view.run.party.find(p=>p.boxId==='alias').moveAliasRepair;assert.ok(preview);const denied=await h.post({action:'repairMoveAliases',boxId:'alias',confirm:true,expectedMoves:['invalid'],revision:0});assert.equal(denied.status,409);assert.equal(h.row().data,before);const response=await h.post({action:'repairMoveAliases',boxId:'alias',confirm:true,expectedMoves:preview.moves,revision:0,...(sketch?{expectedSketchPP:preview.sketchPP,removeIndex:2}:{})});assert.equal(response.status,200);const result=await response.json();assert.deepEqual(result.battle.requests,view.battle.requests);assert.equal(result.battle.turn,view.battle.turn);const saved=await storage.decodeGameData(h.row().data),run=saved.classic.slots[0];assert.deepEqual(run.mystery,doc.classic.slots[0].mystery);assert.deepEqual(run.challenges,doc.classic.slots[0].challenges);assert.deepEqual(run.combat.challengeRestrictions,doc.classic.slots[0].combat.challengeRestrictions);assert.deepEqual(saved.classic.slots[1],{id:'other',safe:true});h.sqlite.close();}});
